# App-authored transition, not from a tape. Grounded in the separately retained
# public F34/35 Gathering description and the owner's attributed 2025 account
# at focus/F34/notes.md. That account cannot reliably split events between 34
# and 35, so this body names the uncertainty and prescribes no encounter.

@segment    climb-f27-f34
@title      Climb — Focus 27 to Focus 34
@levels     F34
@from       F27
@fixed
@verbosity  3
@protected  Focus 34
@duration   ~1m35s

say From Focus 27, you will move through the count to Focus 34.
pause 4
say The public map names Focus 34 and 35 together as the Gathering. One attributed account also describes a gathering and a dark starfield, but does not reliably separate what occurred at 34 from what occurred at 35.
pause 7
say Carry those as maps, not requirements. You do not need to perceive a presence, a gathering, or any particular scene.
pause 6
say Let the numbers mark the movement, and observe what is actually present.
pause 5
level F34
say Twenty-seven.
pause 5
say Twenty-eight.
pause 5
say Twenty-nine.
pause 5
say Thirty.
pause 5
say Thirty-one.
pause 5
say Thirty-two.
pause 5
say Thirty-three.
pause 5
say Thirty-four.
pause 4
say Focus 34.
pause 8
